MOSAIC-SoC contributors

The people who wrote MOSAIC-SoC are recorded in the git history of this
repository. Run "git shortlog -sn" to list them.

MOSAIC-SoC builds on X-HEEP (https://github.com/x-heep/x-heep), written by the
X-HEEP contributors. The other projects this repository includes, and their
copyright holders, are listed in NOTICE and UPSTREAM.md.
